   - **`apps/hazy-note/next.config.ts`** (edited — phase-conditional, same pattern): `serverExternalPackages: isDev ? [] : ["drizzle-orm", "@neondatabase/serverless"]`, `devIndicators: { position: "bottom-right" }`, `outputFileTracingRoot: repoRoot`, `outputFileTracingIncludes` for `../../node_modules/postgres` + `@neondatabase/serverless`.

   - **`apps/hazy/package.json`** (edited): `next: "16.3.0"`, scripts `"build": "next build --turbopack"`, `"dev": "next dev --turbopack --port 3100"`, `"start": "next start --port 3100"`, `cf:*` scripts, `@clerk/backend: "^3.16.13"` added.

